{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1108333-scrying-umbra","id":1108333,"title":"Scrying umbra.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-27T03:31:42-07:00","id":1108333,"title":"Scrying umbra.","content":"What rank of spirit do I need to have in order to scry umbra FROM skinlands and attack from there as well.<br /> Let's say, per say that I've Correspondence 3 and Forces 4. I want to attack someone who's in umbra, from skinlands (While I, myself am in skinlands) with forces 3. What rank of spirit would I need to do that, 2 or 3?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12376-mowtekpvp","name":"MowtekPvP","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-27T03:46:43-07:00","id":1108334,"title":"","content":"I'd say Spirit 2 to reach beyond the gauntlet. Spirit 3 to go beyond the penumbra, and spirit 5 to go into space (break the dream shell)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-27T07:31:43-07:00","id":1108388,"title":"","content":"With Spirit 1 you can see the Penumbra. Spirit 2 allows to attack from the skinlands. You need Prime2/Forces 3/Spirit 2 to launch a classic fireball to the Penumbra without leaving the material realm. Further realms require Correspondence (with an increased difficulty because you're using Corr on the Umbra) and may need additional Spheres or a higher level of Spirit depending on the place you're targeting (I.E Correspondence5/Spirit 5 to reach the Deep Umbra).<br /> <br /> If you play with the Avatar Storm, you may receive damage if you reach trough the Gauntlet this way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1683-aleph","name":"Aleph","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3056"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-27T07:57:47-07:00","id":1108406,"title":"","content":"If you merely send an effect trough the storm, then you suffer no damage, but the effect would be scrambled by a 5 point storm resonance.<br /> If you want to be certain that the effect works as intended, you have to enter the Penumbra, if only wiith a part.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}